                "text": "I voted NO on House Republicans\u2019 big ugly bill.\n\nThis legislation threatens to strip millions of Americans of their health care and food assistance. It includes nearly $880 billion in cuts to Medicaid and $300 billion to SNAP, potentially leaving over 13.7 million people without health coverage and nearly 3 million without food assistance.\n\nThis fight isn\u2019t over.",
