                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Absolutely shameful: The GOP\u2019s rescission bill rips $9 billion from foreign aid, NPR, and PBS. Millions worldwide: Afghan kids, Haitian families, Pakistani women...will lose food, medicine, hope. This isn\u2019t fiscal responsibility, it\u2019s cruelty and moral failure. #StopTheCuts",
