                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "President Trump and world leaders must act now to stop Prime Minister Netanyahu from using food and medicine as weapons. \n\nWhat\u2019s happening in Gaza is a humanitarian crisis that does not reflect our values. \n\nNetanyahu\u2019s war crimes must be stopped.",
