                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "24 years later, we still remember the lives lost on 9/11 and the bravery of the first responders who ran toward danger. Their courage and the strength of their families continue to inspire us, even as survivors face ongoing health challenges.\n\nToday, cuts to the World Trade Center Health Program are forcing survivors and responders to wait longer for the care they urgently need.\n\nAs we remember, we must honor their sacrifice not just in words, but in action.\n\nWe will never forget.",
