                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Shanah Tovah! In the midst of increasingly difficult times for the Jewish community in America and around the world, may this season of renewal bring you and your family peace, happiness and good health. \n\nWishing all those celebrating in #IL01 a\u00a0happy, healthy and sweet new year. Shanah Tovah U'metukah!",
